  "description": "A new collection of short stories by Kim Dal. It is strange and mysterious, like the story of Scheherazade of the Arabian Nights that whispers to the king under the starlight. The story of an exotic sultan, the emperor's youngest daughter, and a dragon overlaps and brings the work to life. Let's listen to their heart-rending stories.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
